AutoAnatomy strips TotalSegmentator down to its head_muscles task and adds a
new Textual-based terminal GUI and headless CLI on top of the retained
nnU-Net inference engine. Its primary task, dental_segmentator, runs an
independently published DentalSegmentator checkpoint (Dot et al., J
Dentistry 2024; CC-BY 4.0) rather than an upstream TotalSegmentator task.

